1
00:00:00,653 --> 00:00:04,410
SEGODNYA VTOROE NOYABRYA TYSYACHA DEVYAT'SOT DEVYANOSTO SED'MOGO GODA.

2
00:00:05,108 --> 00:00:06,471
MY BERЁM INTERV'YU

3
00:00:06,471 --> 00:00:13,680
U FEL'DMAN BRUKHI MOSHKOVNY. INTERV'YU BERЁT LEONID SAPOZHNIKOV. MY NAKHODIMSYA V GORODE BERSHAD', UKRAINE.

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,099
YAZYK NASHEGO INTERV'YU — IDISH

5
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,838
I RUSSKIY. KASSETA NOMER DVA.

6
00:00:21,274 --> 00:00:23,242
BRUNYA, VY

7
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:27,236
VYROSLI ZDES'. KONECHNO, VY BYLI REBЁNKOM, VY MALO CHTO MOZHETE

8
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:29,660
POMNIT', NO VY ZNAETE O TOM, CHTO

9
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,663
ZDES' BYLI TYSYCHA EVREEV

10
00:00:31,872 --> 00:00:34,279
IZ DRUGIKH MEST, VY ZNAETE OB ETOM?

11
00:00:34,335 --> 00:00:37,872
ikh veys. s'iz geven shtark a sakh yidn do.

12
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:42,690
RASSKAZHITE, CHTO VY ZNAETE OB ETOM, CHTO ZDES' BYL- O TOM, CHTO ZDES' BYL⟨UNK⟩...

13
00:00:38,666 --> 00:00:39,666
⟨s-⟩

14
00:00:41,642 --> 00:00:42,800
fun di yidn?

15
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,070
DA, fun di yidn.

16
00:00:43,498 --> 00:00:49,837
az s'hot gelebt do di yidn, iz geven freylekh. ikh hob gevoynt PO PERVOMAYSKe gas oykhet.

17
00:00:47,308 --> 00:00:48,308
UNK

18
00:00:50,248 --> 00:00:52,436
nu, fleg ikh aroysgeyn oyf der nakht,

19
00:00:52,678 --> 00:00:59,422
fleg aroysgeyn khevre, yidishe khevre, mit yidishe meydlekh. me fleg nemen a gitare, me fleg shpiln,

20
00:00:59,513 --> 00:01:04,091
un me fleg zingen, un s'iz geven freylekh. s'iz geven a freylekhdike gas.

21
00:01:04,091 --> 00:01:05,750
yidn zenen geven.

22
00:01:05,942 --> 00:01:10,520
itstert o, kh'gey aroys oyf der nakht, hob ikh shoyn moyre. finef a, nayn a zeyger,

23
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:12,857
akht a zeyger, me zitst shoyn yeder in der heym,

24
00:01:12,857 --> 00:01:15,504
me geyt shoyn keyner nit aroys; m'hot moyre.

25
00:01:15,696 --> 00:01:17,394
far vemen hot men moyre?

26
00:01:17,569 --> 00:01:23,233
se geyt di ukrayntses: der geyt shiker, der geyt shiker, un m'hot moyre, me zol gebn a klop,

27
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:24,397
un VSЁ.

28
00:01:24,471 --> 00:01:27,058
iz geven a, iz geven a freylekhdike

29
00:01:27,058 --> 00:01:29,440
yidishe shtot, Bershed,

30
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:34,134
vos ikh voyn, ⟨ikh bin dokh geb-⟩ ikh bin geboyrn gevorn do, un ikh voyn do,

31
00:01:34,309 --> 00:01:39,520
iz v- volt ikh nit POMENYAet ⟨ergets⟩ andersh, aza freylekhdike G- Bershed iz geven do.

32
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:44,979
yidishe khevre, s'iz geven, me fleg aroysgeyn, se fleg, lebn ⟨KAZ⟩⟨UNK⟩ budke,

33
00:01:44,979 --> 00:01:48,278
s'iz geven azoy freylekh ⟨az PRYAM ikh veys nit⟩. itster o, UZHE VSЁ.

34
00:01:48,278 --> 00:01:54,502
m'iz ale avekgeforn in IZRAIL' I VSЁ, di yidn. ⟨s'iz dokh⟩ nishto keyn yidn do itster I VSЁ, nor s'iz friert geven milyonen yidn,

35
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:56,380
TYSYACHA milyonen,

36
00:01:56,380 --> 00:02:01,947
a, a gas mit, yidn. me fleg aroysgeyn: der iz geven a yidishke, der iz geven a yidishke. ⟨me⟩ fleg zogn a gut-morgn, a gut-yor.

37
00:02:01,947 --> 00:02:05,218
itster iz nishto vemen tsu zogn: tsigayners mit goyim, I VSЁ.

38
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:12,086
A PO KAKIM ULITSAM, BOL'SHE ⟨GU- ⟩, PO KAKIM EVREYSKIM ULITSAM ⟨BOL'SHE⟩ UNK ⟨GULYALI⟩ UNK?

39
00:02:09,139 --> 00:02:13,436
ЕTO PO ULITSE LENINA BYLO, PO PERVOMAYSKOY.

40
00:02:13,645 --> 00:02:17,081
VOT ET⟨UNK⟩, OSOBENNO PO PERVOMAYSKOY ULITSE geven.

41
00:02:18,994 --> 00:02:21,789
VY POMNITE ETO, DA? VY, KOGDA ⟨V-⟩

42
00:02:19,905 --> 00:02:22,737
ETO ikh... voden? ikh farshtey nit? ⟨ze nor.⟩

43
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:26,126
K- KOGDA VASHI SVERSTNIKI TOGDA, GULYALI...

44
00:02:22,737 --> 00:02:23,746
⟨ikh bin geven...⟩

45
00:02:24,158 --> 00:02:28,854
KONECHNO, I MOEGO VOZRAST⟨UNK⟩ KHLO-, KHLOPTSY I DEVCHATA,

46
00:02:28,854 --> 00:02:31,256
un s'iz geven, nit mayn VOZRAST.

47
00:02:31,752 --> 00:02:36,210
me fleg aroysgeyn, ⟨me⟩ fleg geyn⟨, me⟩ fleg zikh on⟨neme⟩n ⟨garn,⟩ me fleg geyn GULYAen, ⟨me⟩ fleg geyn

48
00:02:36,210 --> 00:02:40,510
in restoran, ⟨me⟩ fleg geyn in bar, un me fleg, ⟨se fleg,⟩ UNK freylekh iz geven.

49
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:43,457
itster shoyn freylekh? me kukt di televizors I VSЁ.

50
00:02:44,526 --> 00:02:46,275
A TOGDA BYLI TELEVIZORY?

51
00:02:47,125 --> 00:02:52,164
dem⟨UNK⟩t iz oykh geven televizors. voden? s'iz nit geven televizors? farshtey⟨t zikh, s'iz oykh geven⟩...

52
00:02:47,192 --> 00:02:48,367
TOGDA ⟨TE-⟩...

53
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:53,510
NO LYUDI VYKHO- NO LYUDI VYKHODILI GULYAT'.

54
00:02:52,795 --> 00:02:56,070
⟨,⟩ m'iz gegangen in kino. ikh fleg aleyn geyn in kino.

55
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,360
ikh fleg hobn lib kino,

56
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:00,821
fleg geyn nemen a bilet, fleg hobn lib kino, fleg hobn lib tantses,

57
00:03:00,962 --> 00:03:05,470
fleg nemen tsvontsik kopekes, fleg geyn in park, iz a mol geven a garmoshke fleg shpiln.

58
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:10,406
s'iz geven a klub a alter un me fleg geyn. s⟨UNK⟩ s'iz geven freylekh. itster iz shoyn gornit nit.

59
00:03:10,581 --> 00:03:17,390
 BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, A POSLE VOYNY, VOT VY OBRASHCHALI VNIMANIE... NU, VY BYLI MOLADAYA...

60
00:03:17,390 --> 00:03:22,450
 VY OBRASHCHALI VNIMANIE O TOM, CHTO, NA TO, CHTO V BERSHADI EST' SINAGOGA, ⟨CHTO⟩ KHODYAT STARIKI?

61
00:03:22,450 --> 00:03:23,771
VY ZNALI OB ETOM?

62
00:03:22,849 --> 00:03:25,461
avade! ve⟨y-⟩ avade veys ikh.

63
00:03:25,461 --> 00:03:29,390
ikh bin aleyn gegangen. ikh hob ongehoybn tsu fastn fun fertsn yor.

64
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,910
⟨INTERESNO⟩.

65
00:03:29,886 --> 00:03:31,325
fun fertsn yor.

66
00:03:31,325 --> 00:03:35,679
gedenk ikh az mayn mame hot gefastn, un mayn mame iz gegangen oykh in shil arayn.

67
00:03:35,679 --> 00:03:40,680
un mayn mame iz gezesn oyvn, un untn gezesn di MUZHCHINes, un oyvn gezesn di ZHENSHCHINes.

68
00:03:40,804 --> 00:03:42,890
fleg zayn bobe ⟨Tsegetses⟩,

69
00:03:42,930 --> 00:03:45,472
⟨oyb ir hot gekent⟩, un fleg zi leyenen.

70
00:03:45,613 --> 00:03:49,049
fleg ikh kumen un fleg hern kadesh nokh a foter,

71
00:03:49,157 --> 00:03:51,221
kadesh nokh a shvester,

72
00:03:51,221 --> 00:03:56,520
kadesh nokh a mame, loz got ophitn, un ikh fleg veynen un fleg fastn oyf der nakht.

73
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:59,748
gedenk ikh dem tog, fertsn yor az ikh bin geven alt,

74
00:03:59,923 --> 00:04:05,868
hob ikh ongenemen,... nu, bin ikh geven oykh a kind, fertsn yor, bin ikh oykh geven a kind, CHETYRNADTSAT' LET...

75
00:04:05,868 --> 00:04:10,020
hob ikh ongenemen a keshene mit PRYANIK⟨ses⟩, mit konfetn.

76
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:12,745
az m'hot gegebn a bloz di DUDOCHKe⟨s⟩,

77
00:04:12,745 --> 00:04:15,628
hob ikh SRAZe genemen in mol arayn; kh'bin dokh geven hungerik!

78
00:04:15,702 --> 00:04:17,250
dos gedenk ikh oykhet.

79
00:04:17,250 --> 00:04:20,255
un gedenk, ikh fleg tomed geyn hern yizker.

80
00:04:20,255 --> 00:04:22,819
fleg men makhn a mole nokhn papen,

81
00:04:22,819 --> 00:04:25,196
fleg men nokh der shvester makhn a mole.

82
00:04:25,742 --> 00:04:26,782
kh'gedenk.

83
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:31,100
UNK SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, TOGDA SOBIRALOS', V TE GODY, MNOGO LYUDEY V SINAGOGE?

84
00:04:30,417 --> 00:04:34,123
o! dem⟨UNK⟩t iz geven a fule shil.

85
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:37,560
yidn MUZHCHINes iz geven ful untn;

86
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:40,367
oyvn iz geven ful ZHENSHCHINes.

87
00:04:40,575 --> 00:04:43,167
ikh gedenk azoy ⟨v- tsu⟩ dem tog,

88
00:04:43,326 --> 00:04:44,653
vos s'iz geven ful,

89
00:04:44,912 --> 00:04:48,196
ful mit yidn ZHENSHCHINes un ful mit MUZHCHINes.

90
00:04:49,317 --> 00:04:53,000
ETO BYLO V PRAZDNICHNYE DNI, ILI ETO BYLO V SUB-

91
00:04:51,915 --> 00:04:54,520
s'iz, geven, KONECHNO,

92
00:04:53,147 --> 00:04:55,140
PYATNITSU VECHEROM?

93
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,651
ven der SUDNYY DEN' iz geven,

94
00:04:56,708 --> 00:04:58,237
ven m'hot gefast,

95
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:00,645
iz geven azoy fil, azoy fil mentshn.

96
00:05:00,645 --> 00:05:02,692
dernokh dem, oyf simkhes-toyre.

97
00:05:02,901 --> 00:05:05,724
az s'iz geven simkhes-toyre iz oykh geven a sakh mentshn.

98
00:05:05,724 --> 00:05:08,570
nu, un di andere PRAZDNIKes iz shoyn nit geven azoy,

99
00:05:08,570 --> 00:05:12,835
nor di yidn, di MUZHCHINes, flegn geyn davenen ale shabes,

100
00:05:13,465 --> 00:05:15,028
VY ZNALI OB ETOM?

101
00:05:14,005 --> 00:05:16,462
 gants fri un oyf der nakht.

102
00:05:16,435 --> 00:05:19,129
VY OB ETOM ZNALI, VY VIDELI ETO SAMI?

103
00:05:17,734 --> 00:05:20,960
YA, YA VIDELA. ikh bin geven dortn.

104
00:05:20,991 --> 00:05:23,630
VY PODKHODILI V SINAGOG⟨U VOT...?⟩

105
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:25,790
A KAK ZHE! kh'bin arayngegangen, fleg onton a shalekhl un fleg arayngeyn, VSЁ.

106
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:28,110
un yomkiper fleg ikh tomed dortn zayn.

107
00:05:28,110 --> 00:05:30,978
me fleg zikh leyenen fun der tkhine fleg men zikh leyenen

108
00:05:30,978 --> 00:05:36,124
di, dem yizker nokh a tatn un yizker nokh a mamen un aldings, fleg ikh hern un VSЁ.

109
00:05:36,124 --> 00:05:41,099
s'iz geven azoyne mentshn, bobe ⟨Tsegetses⟩, s'iz geven andere vos m'hot gekent gut leyenen oyf yidish,

110
00:05:41,562 --> 00:05:42,939
iz ho'mir gehert,

111
00:05:43,401 --> 00:05:46,440
az m'hot gezogt yizker nokh a tatn, yizker nokh a mame.

112
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:49,210
KHOTYA vos kh'hob nit farshtanen oyf yidish, nor kh'hob zikh gehert

113
00:05:49,210 --> 00:05:52,198
az yizker nokh a tatn un yizker ⟨nokh a⟩ mame. dem tog hob ikh,

114
00:05:52,198 --> 00:05:55,983
iz hob ikh ongehoybn tsu veynen un aldings. ikh gedenk aldings.

115
00:05:56,293 --> 00:05:59,550
A VY SAMI CHITALI PO- POMINAL'NYE MOLITVY?

116
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,607
NE, NE.

117
00:06:00,647 --> 00:06:02,531
ot dos hob ikh nit geleyent, neyn.

118
00:06:02,757 --> 00:06:04,438
ikh ken nit leyenen oykhet,

119
00:06:05,507 --> 00:06:09,970
I VSЁ. az me git mir a yidishe bikhl, vel ikh nit leyenen; ikh ken nit.

120
00:06:10,249 --> 00:06:12,217
vos zhe zol ikh leyenen az ikh ken nit?

121
00:06:12,662 --> 00:06:15,913
NU, RAZGOVARIVAETE NA IDISH VY OCHEN' KHOROSHO.

122
00:06:15,497 --> 00:06:18,191
RAZGOVARIVAT', DA, redn red ikh gut.

123
00:06:18,552 --> 00:06:22,208
⟨NU,⟩ ETO TOZHE SEYCHAS B- BOL'SHAYA REDKOST'; ⟨NE KAZHDYY...⟩

124
00:06:21,049 --> 00:06:24,480
nu, vos zhe ken ikh makhn? kh'red gut, un VSЁ.

125
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,097
nor mit di kinder red ikh nit, oyf yidish.

126
00:06:28,542 --> 00:06:34,206
 nor di k- di ⟨oy-⟩ groyse hot zikh shoyn oysgelernt a bisl yidish, iz redt zi shoyn mit mir a bisl yidish.

127
00:06:34,228 --> 00:06:36,770
un er zogt, "vos zogstu? vos zogstu?"

128
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:39,510
⟨zi leygt im⟩ iber....

129
00:06:42,075 --> 00:06:46,676
 SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, POSLE VOYNY BYLA ODNA SINAGOGA

130
00:06:47,188 --> 00:06:48,734
V BERSHADI, ILI UNK

131
00:06:47,661 --> 00:06:52,000
neyn. s'iz geven, eyn sinagoge, zogt men,

132
00:06:48,910 --> 00:06:50,018
UNK

133
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,957
 kh'hob gehert, oto do vu ULITSA LENINA,

134
00:06:56,082 --> 00:06:58,601
aroyf, iz dortn geven epes a sinagoge.

135
00:06:58,601 --> 00:07:01,796
dernokh dem iz, oto di sinagoge VSЁ VREMYA,

136
00:07:02,697 --> 00:07:05,360
 ETA SINAGOGA, CHTO SEYCHAS EST',

137
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,047
⟨iz shoyn, shoyn⟩ VSЁ VREMYA

138
00:07:07,047 --> 00:07:10,014
⟨UNK⟩⟨T⟩ ETO MESTO VSЁ SINAGOG.

139
00:07:11,893 --> 00:07:14,485
zi iz azoy vi a geboyrene sinagoge, oto di.

140
00:07:14,728 --> 00:07:17,129
derfar tor men zi nit aropnemen,

141
00:07:17,129 --> 00:07:19,008
derfar makht men azoy fil remont,

142
00:07:19,032 --> 00:07:20,663
vayl me tor zi nit aropnem-...

143
00:07:19,032 --> 00:07:22,080
A CHTO ZNACHIT "a geboyrene"? CHTO VY IMEETE V VIDU?

144
00:07:21,765 --> 00:07:24,454
NU, ZA TO, CHTO EY NEL'ZYA SNIMAT',

145
00:07:24,454 --> 00:07:27,810
POTOMU CHTO ONA, NA MESTE STOIT, I KAK ONA

146
00:07:27,810 --> 00:07:29,893
geboyrn, ETO KAK ONA RODILAS',

147
00:07:30,625 --> 00:07:31,990
ETA SINGAGOG.

148
00:07:31,990 --> 00:07:34,511
⟨iz⟩ DELAET ZHE EFIM REMONT VSЁ VREMYA,

149
00:07:33,831 --> 00:07:34,702
DA.

150
00:07:34,511 --> 00:07:37,726
CHTOBY EЁ NE SNIMAT', CHTOBY PODDERZHIVAT' EЁ,

151
00:07:37,726 --> 00:07:41,650
I CHTOBY LYUDI KHODILI, NU, SKOL'KO NAS TAM IDUT, RADI BOGA.

152
00:07:41,650 --> 00:07:42,937
nu, vos ken ⟨men⟩ makhn?

153
00:07:44,479 --> 00:07:48,509
A KAK VY OTSENIVAETE VOT, RAZNOST',

154
00:07:48,509 --> 00:07:51,918
 V, EVREYSKOM NASELENII BERSHADI,

155
00:07:51,918 --> 00:07:55,175
 TEPER', DOPUSTIM, PYATNADTSAT', DVADTSAT' LET NAZAD?

156
00:07:55,175 --> 00:07:59,630
 CHUVSTVUETSYA VOT NA VASHEM OBRAZE ZHIZNI, KROME TOGO, CHTO

157
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:01,520
VECHEROM UZHE LYUDEY NETU,

158
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:04,082
 NA ULITSE, KAK VY GOVORITE UNK

159
00:08:03,042 --> 00:08:05,586
nu, vos, vos ken ikh itster CHUVSTVen?

160
00:08:05,586 --> 00:08:09,590
az se kumt oyfdernakht, zets zikh un kuk zikh ⟨avek dem⟩ televizor, leyg zikh shlofn.

161
00:08:09,590 --> 00:08:11,742
vu zhe gey ikh? ikh gey in er⟨gets⟩ nit.

162
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:15,051
nu, un me darf zikh a mol SOOBSHCHAen mit di goyim oykhet.

163
00:08:15,293 --> 00:08:21,516
iz ot nekhtn, iz afile hot men mikh gerufn in L- azh mitn eydem bin ikh geforn azh in,

164
00:08:21,516 --> 00:08:22,762
in LISNYCHE.

165
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:26,646
iz, bin ikh mit zey gut, tsen yor

166
00:08:26,646 --> 00:08:28,443
bin ikh mit zey, gut.

167
00:08:28,443 --> 00:08:32,880
zey UVAZHAen mikh, un ikh UVAZHAe zey. m'hot zikh gekusht mit mir un aldings.

168
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:35,270
zey zogn mir nekhtn, "for nit in IZRAILe;

169
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,106
mir'n zikh benken nokh dir!"

170
00:08:37,246 --> 00:08:40,733
zog ikh, "nu, veln mir lebn, veln mir zen," zog ikh. vos zol ikh zey zogn?

171
00:08:40,926 --> 00:08:44,430
nu, me darf zikh a mol mit zey oykh SOOBSHCHAen. az du voynst do,

172
00:08:44,436 --> 00:08:46,370
muzst zikh mit zey SOOBSHCHAen;

173
00:08:46,461 --> 00:08:48,446
anit vet men onshpayen in ponem.

174
00:08:48,418 --> 00:08:49,570
PRAVIL'NO.

175
00:08:50,292 --> 00:08:53,452
A KAK U VAS OTNOSHENIYA S VASHIMI SVATAMI

176
00:08:50,393 --> 00:08:51,349
UNK

177
00:08:53,452 --> 00:08:56,790
UKRAINSKIMI? KHOROSHIE ⟨OTNOSHENIYA⟩?

178
00:08:55,219 --> 00:08:59,921
 bay mir iz, di, di, zayn, zayn mame iz geshtorbn.

179
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:03,246
dem eydem's mame iz geshtorbn,

180
00:09:03,454 --> 00:09:06,277
iz zi nishto. er hot nor a bruder.

181
00:09:06,277 --> 00:09:11,940
nu, es iz bay im, dem bruder, IMENINY, s'iz bay ir IMENINY, s'iz baym kind, ruft men mikh.

182
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:14,467
m'⟨OBSHCH⟩Aet zikh mit mir nishkoshe.

183
00:09:15,216 --> 00:09:22,348
VSЁ. kum ikh tsu geyn, breng ikh a PODAROK, zits ikh un, un es op dortn tsi vos, tsi, tsi kh'trink op tsi vos, I VSЁ.

184
00:09:22,455 --> 00:09:23,833
un gey mikh avek.

185
00:09:25,223 --> 00:09:26,660
⟨YASNO⟩.

186
00:09:25,307 --> 00:09:28,001
s'iz a gut-morgn, a gut-yor. kh'ze zey.

187
00:09:28,935 --> 00:09:34,050
NU, VSЁ RAVNO, U VAS, DVOE VNUKOV KHOROSHIKH I ETO NAVERNOE

188
00:09:33,070 --> 00:09:34,447
do, yo.

189
00:09:34,050 --> 00:09:36,590
IMEET BOL'SHOE ZNACHENIE V VASHEY ZHIZNI,...

190
00:09:35,854 --> 00:09:39,774
DA, I TA D- DEVOCHKA, CHTO, vos in Ades, KONECHNO.

191
00:09:37,896 --> 00:09:40,090
UNK

192
00:09:39,774 --> 00:09:41,012
ikh hob zey lib.

193
00:09:41,085 --> 00:09:43,714
er shloft bay mir, ikh fir im in SADIK.

194
00:09:43,714 --> 00:09:47,306
er iz BOL'SHINSTVO bay mir. ikh gey zey NAVSTRECHe, di kinder.

195
00:09:47,397 --> 00:09:52,031
ver den vet geyn NAVSTRECHе? a mame muz geyn NAVSTRECHе, a bobe. VSЁ.

196
00:09:53,134 --> 00:09:58,865
az dos eltere eynikl ligt bay mir itster in BOL'NITSe, gey ikh in BOL'NITSe, trog ir op epes un,

197
00:09:59,057 --> 00:10:03,793
un zi zogt, "BABUSHKA, kh'hob dikh lib," un aldings., ⟨iz⟩ hob ikh a UDOVOL'STVe.

198
00:10:06,212 --> 00:10:07,570
PONYATNO.

199
00:10:08,507 --> 00:10:13,870
SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA, VY, VASHI DETI UNK DOCH' VASHA INTERESUETSYA V KAKOY-TO STEPENI,

200
00:10:13,870 --> 00:10:17,940
 EVREYSKIM YAZYKOM, CHEM-TO TAKIM, ⟨⟩...

201
00:10:16,455 --> 00:10:22,696
DA, DA, DA. zi re- ONA, zi farshteyt aldings oyf yidish, aldings, nor zi ken nit redn.

202
00:10:22,696 --> 00:10:25,764
azoy vi ⟨z-⟩ redn ken zi nit, nor zi redt shoyn a bisl oykhet.

203
00:10:26,108 --> 00:10:29,983
un, zi zogt, "ven ikh bin," zogt zi, "azoy oyf Anye's ort"...

204
00:10:30,090 --> 00:10:36,327
ven, zi darf zikh nemen bay im a RAZRESHENIE, zi zol forn un aldings, er ken zi nit oplozn in IZRAILe... "ven ikh bin oyf Anyen,"

205
00:10:36,452 --> 00:10:39,044
zogt zi, "f- for ikh bald avek mit dir, MAMA."

206
00:10:39,355 --> 00:10:43,449
yo, Maye iz azoy bay mir, zi iz a shtarke bistre bay mir,

207
00:10:43,523 --> 00:10:46,370
un yene iz a shtile, I VSЁ. vos zhe ken ikh makhn?

208
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:48,405
nor zey STARAen zikh,

209
00:10:48,405 --> 00:10:50,351
tsu redn oyf yidish ⟨DAL'SHЕ⟩.

210
00:10:50,593 --> 00:10:51,852
UNK

211
00:10:50,678 --> 00:10:52,581
ot di klenere tokhter

212
00:10:52,581 --> 00:10:56,581
in Ades, vos zi voynt, kumt zi tsu geyn, heybt zi on tsu redn mit mir oyf yidish.

213
00:10:56,581 --> 00:10:58,437
un dos eynikl oykhet,

214
00:10:58,437 --> 00:11:00,023
kumt zi arayn, zogt zi

215
00:11:00,023 --> 00:11:02,079
UNK "a gute nakht,"

216
00:11:02,119 --> 00:11:08,120
un heybt oykh on tsu redn ot azoy o, NESMOTRYA vos zi iz gegangen in, in der RUSSK⟨er⟩ shkole.

217
00:11:09,004 --> 00:11:12,643
ONA POSHLA V RUSSKU- RUSSKUYU SHKOLU in Ades, in ershtn klas.

218
00:11:13,122 --> 00:11:15,960
NU, EVREYSKIKH SHKOL NET V ODESE, ⟨KONECHNO⟩.

219
00:11:14,995 --> 00:11:16,280
KONECHNO NET.

220
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,420
UNK

221
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:20,661
neyn, zi zogt, mayn tokhter hot gezogt azoy: az in Ades iz do,

222
00:11:20,661 --> 00:11:24,658
DOPUSTIM az ⟨a,⟩ kinder viln zikh geyn lernen ivrit,

223
00:11:24,613 --> 00:11:26,570
⟨, s'iz do aza...⟩

224
00:11:25,153 --> 00:11:26,834
geyen zey zikh lernen.

225
00:11:26,773 --> 00:11:27,931
ivrit yo.

226
00:11:27,448 --> 00:11:30,040
yo. me geyt arayn un me lernt zikh ivrit.

227
00:11:30,722 --> 00:11:33,163
NU, ⟨ONA ESHCHЁ⟩ MALEN'KIY REBЁNOK, DA?

228
00:11:32,427 --> 00:11:34,300
zi iz gegangen in ershtn klas,

229
00:11:33,692 --> 00:11:39,271
PERVYY KLASS. NU, ⟨ONA UZHE⟩ MOZHET BYT' I V TAKUYU VOSKRESNUYU SHKOLU UNK

230
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:35,408
PERVYY KLASS.

231
00:11:38,012 --> 00:11:42,405
ikh'l aykh zogn dem emes: shoyn MEZHDU PROCHIM di kinder ivrit

232
00:11:42,405 --> 00:11:44,503
khapn SRAZe iber.

233
00:11:44,593 --> 00:11:47,591
mayn eynikl iz geven in PIONERSKIY LAGER',

234
00:11:44,813 --> 00:11:46,089
kleyne kinder.

235
00:11:47,715 --> 00:11:51,480
in Khmelnik, hot men zi genemen, a yidishe, iz geven.

236
00:11:51,664 --> 00:11:56,315
iz, geven ot der fun Vinitse, der BORODATYY... ikh hob fargesn zayn familye...

237
00:11:56,473 --> 00:12:00,196
iz zi hot zikh im shtark PONRAVet. zi hot im ongeshribn a briv itster.

238
00:12:00,287 --> 00:12:03,210
hot zi iberge- a lid, a ivrit,

239
00:12:03,291 --> 00:12:05,590
un zi zingt zi oyf ivrit.

240
00:12:05,772 --> 00:12:07,858
zi hot zikh dortn oysgelernt un zi ken.

241
00:12:08,792 --> 00:12:10,540
a kind lernt.

242
00:12:09,501 --> 00:12:14,017
yo. un itstert o zingt zi oykhet. ⟨FIMA⟩ hot zi genemen in a grupe un zi zingt.

243
00:12:14,698 --> 00:12:17,240
vos FIMA zingt mitn kind, zingt zi oykhet.

244
00:12:18,445 --> 00:12:21,847
un der kleyner heybt oykhet on tsu zingen. er vil oykhet zingen.

245
00:12:22,798 --> 00:12:25,240
d- der, der eynikl?

246
00:12:22,849 --> 00:12:24,921
⟨az⟩ zey forn, m⟨ir zenen⟩ geforn in der mashin...

247
00:12:24,921 --> 00:12:27,495
yo. mir zenen geforn nekhtn in der mashin in LISNYCHE,

248
00:12:27,495 --> 00:12:30,943
hot er ongehoybn tsu zingen "sholem-aleykhem." efsher zingt er nokhet.

249
00:12:31,742 --> 00:12:32,546
VSЁ.

250
00:12:33,717 --> 00:12:40,230
KHOROSHO UNK VOT TAKIM VOT SPOSOBOM, PESNEY I TAM KAKIMI-TO RASSKAZAMI, SOKHRANYAETSYA VOT ETOT MINIMUM,

251
00:12:38,627 --> 00:12:41,169
DA, SOKHRANYAETSYA, DA, MI⟨UNK⟩.

252
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:42,790
MINIMUM ETOGO EVREYSTVA...

253
00:12:41,361 --> 00:12:44,325
DA, un di kinder nemen SRAZe iber.

254
00:12:45,192 --> 00:12:50,390
NU, PO-, MOZHNO PONYAT', CHTO VASHI DETI, VASHI VNUKI, ONI KAK-TO,

255
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:53,320
 LITSOM POVЁRNUTY K,

256
00:12:51,773 --> 00:12:54,703
DA, TAK K EVREYAM, DA. DA.

257
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:58,740
K EVREYAM I K, K V- MOZHNO SKAZAT', K VAM POVЁRNUT⟨UNK⟩...

258
00:12:54,895 --> 00:12:57,201
DA. DA.

259
00:12:57,358 --> 00:13:00,493
dos eltere meydele kumt tsu geyn,

260
00:13:00,493 --> 00:13:01,857
fun der shkole,

261
00:13:01,864 --> 00:13:06,954
zogt zi, "MAMA, du veyst vos m'hot mir gezogt in shkole? m'hot mir gezogt az ikh bin a ZHYDIVKA."

262
00:13:07,467 --> 00:13:12,962
hot er gehert un iz gegangen, hot zikh ISPRAVet di shkole, "vos heyst⟨, z-⟩ zogst azoy oyf a kind?"

263
00:13:13,508 --> 00:13:16,725
u⟨n⟩ m'hot ⟨ir⟩ UNK ⟨vos iz? di⟩ mame iz a yidishke.

264
00:13:18,250 --> 00:13:19,860
vos ken men makhn?

265
00:13:20,325 --> 00:13:23,441
UNK ETO BYLO STARSHAYA VNUCHKA, TAKOY SLUCHAY?

266
00:13:22,705 --> 00:13:28,211
 nu, di eltere, s'eltere eynikl hot mir gezogt un UNK gekumen, ⟨dertseylt⟩ dem foter mit der muter

267
00:13:28,211 --> 00:13:29,921
az m'hot ir gezogt ot dos o.

268
00:13:32,897 --> 00:13:35,388
ETO BYL- ETO, SEYCHAS ONA V KAKOM KLASSE?

269
00:13:35,462 --> 00:13:36,553
in ferdn.

270
00:13:36,458 --> 00:13:37,819
MALEN'KAYA ESHCHЁ.

271
00:13:37,943 --> 00:13:39,658
ferdn, tsen yor.

272
00:13:40,609 --> 00:13:43,829
nu, zi farshteyt aldings. ot ligt zi aleyn itstert o in BOL'NITSe.

273
00:13:43,829 --> 00:13:45,176
me git zi a UKOL.

274
00:13:46,262 --> 00:13:47,504
⟨, zi⟩ ligt.

275
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:47,471
zi iz shlaf?

276
00:13:48,152 --> 00:13:50,306
zi hot zikh tsugekilt dem MOCHEVOY PUZYR'.

277
00:13:49,384 --> 00:13:50,670
⟨tsugekilt⟩.

278
00:13:52,135 --> 00:13:53,360
⟨tsugekilt⟩.

279
00:13:53,890 --> 00:13:56,770
DEVOCHKA. hot zikh avekgezetst UNK

280
00:13:54,801 --> 00:13:57,632
 BRUNYA, U VAS EST' PODRUGI,

281
00:13:57,632 --> 00:14:03,029
 ⟨D-⟩ KOTORYE TOZHE B-... MOZHET BYT' DET'MI, MOZHET BYT' CHUT' STARSHE, MOZHET BYT'...

282
00:14:02,344 --> 00:14:07,147
U MENYA, ikh bin g- kh'hob gehat PODRUGes, nor ale zenen zey in IZRAILe.

283
00:14:03,357 --> 00:14:04,650
BYLI V GETTO.

284
00:14:07,643 --> 00:14:13,343
zenen avekgeforn. kh'hob gehat gute PODRUGes, un m'iz avekgeforn mit di kinder. m'iz dortn mit di kinder I VSЁ.

285
00:14:13,343 --> 00:14:16,160
ale PODRUGes, ale mayne, zenen dort.

286
00:14:16,941 --> 00:14:18,791
do hob ikh shoyn nit keyn PODRUGe.

287
00:14:19,017 --> 00:14:22,133
do iz Dusye. zi SCHITAet zikh mayn eygene.

288
00:14:22,459 --> 00:14:23,949
⟨ah, vi⟩ azoy iz zi mayn eygene?

289
00:14:23,949 --> 00:14:27,364
zayn ersht vayb iz geven mayn DVOYURODNe shvester,

290
00:14:27,572 --> 00:14:29,490
Mishe's, vayb,

291
00:14:29,682 --> 00:14:34,167
un Dusye's, mame iz geven mayn mame's PLEMYANNITSe. V OBSHCHEM zenen mir ⟨undz⟩ tsvey,

292
00:14:34,167 --> 00:14:37,480
I VSЁ. Dusye kumt tsu geyn tsu mir, ikh kum tsu geyn tsu Dusyen,

293
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:38,991
un mir redn, I VSЁ.

294
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:41,909
un, hobn PODRUGes do hob ikh shoyn nit.

295
00:14:43,450 --> 00:14:44,220
⟨...⟩

296
00:14:43,502 --> 00:14:46,907
un P- PODRUGes, fun der arbet, zeen zey mikh,

297
00:14:46,907 --> 00:14:49,334
zogn zey mir, "⟨ZDRASTUY⟩!" ikh zog zey.

298
00:14:49,645 --> 00:14:53,149
me shteyt un me redt etlekhe... "⟨YAK TY ZHYVESH?⟩" ⟨vi azoy⟩ UNK...

299
00:14:51,737 --> 00:14:54,228
A yidishe, A yidishe nishto?

300
00:14:53,830 --> 00:14:55,860
yidishe nishto, neyn.

301
00:14:55,939 --> 00:14:59,223
yidishe iz do, yidishe iz do bay mir a PODRUGe,

302
00:14:56,243 --> 00:14:57,790
nor Dusye.

303
00:14:59,533 --> 00:15:03,324
 Trenker⟨, vos,⟩ SARA. shraybt zi ⟨v-⟩ "kum!

304
00:15:03,415 --> 00:15:08,387
mir'n dir helfn in IZRAILe," un aldings. zi hot ibergegebn mit Fanyen. ⟨,⟩ Fanye iz ⟨dokh⟩ geven do,

305
00:15:08,511 --> 00:15:11,593
Fanye UNK. me shray⟨t⟩ ale, kh'zol kumen, I VSЁ.

306
00:15:14,147 --> 00:15:19,700
nu, kumen tsu, NADO SOGLASOVAT' S DET'MI, ⟨S VNUKAMI⟩ UNK

307
00:15:17,438 --> 00:15:21,043
nu, UNK, avade. se shteyt bay mir nor ⟨a⟩ OSTANOVKe fun dem kind.

308
00:15:21,336 --> 00:15:23,169
TAK PROSTO NE DELAETSYA.

309
00:15:22,838 --> 00:15:27,000
аz dos kind vet zogn, vel ikh forn; ikh TERYAe do gornit nit. far vos zhe...?

310
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,730
vel ikh farkoyfn di KOMNATe,

311
00:15:28,730 --> 00:15:33,902
vel ikh nemen, gelt, vel ikh UNK IZMENYAen oyf dolars. ikh'l hobn,

312
00:15:33,958 --> 00:15:35,943
kh'vel zikh nit forn mit di leydike hent.

313
00:15:37,266 --> 00:15:40,334
nu, dos kind, ven, u⟨h,⟩ zi iz bay mir a gramote, yene,

314
00:15:40,334 --> 00:15:45,413
di kleyne, un di, un, zi volt gekent, un me darf forn in Kiv, un me darf... es iz,

315
00:15:45,413 --> 00:15:46,864
UNK

316
00:15:46,864 --> 00:15:49,430
me darf hobn di DOKUMENTn. UNK

317
00:15:49,430 --> 00:15:51,890
zi shraybt mir fun IZRAILe, di PLEMYANNITSe,

318
00:15:52,150 --> 00:15:55,049
"far a khoydesh vestu aroysnemen di DOKUMENTn, TЁTYA."

319
00:15:55,049 --> 00:16:00,580
far a khoydesh. nu, loz zayn far a khoydesh. ober UNK azoy tut zikh nit, az me darf farkoyfn di kvartire, un fun kvartire.

320
00:15:58,866 --> 00:16:00,460
UNK

321
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:01,948
se geyt iber halb yor,

322
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,471
yo.

323
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:04,124
az me SOGLASHAet zikh.

324
00:16:07,742 --> 00:16:20,340
 BRUNYA, A VOT TO, CHTO VY VMESTE SO SVOEY SEM'ЁY, PEREZHILI GETTO KOGDA-TO IMELO ZNACHENIE V VASHEY ZHIZNI POSLEDUYUSHCHEY? KTO-TO VAM KOGDA-TO VSPOMINAL OB ETOM, KTO-TO VAM GOVORIL OB ETOM

325
00:16:20,340 --> 00:16:23,024
NA RABOTE, ILI TAK, ILI NA ULITSE?

326
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:27,480
NA RABOTE MNE NE GOVORILI. ONI NE ZNALI, VO-PERVYKH,

327
00:16:27,604 --> 00:16:29,229
un ikh hob zey nit gezogt.

328
00:16:29,229 --> 00:16:33,659
A P- dernokh dem hobn zey UZNAet, heyst es oyf der arbet,

329
00:16:33,659 --> 00:16:40,040
CHTO MY B- MY BYLI V GETTO UNK mir zenen geven in geto, hot men ⟨der,⟩ oyf der RABOTE mir gezogt.

330
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:44,197
nu, hot men gehat gegebn, dortn POMOSHCH'

331
00:16:44,197 --> 00:16:47,530
di INVALIDY ⟨OTECHESTVENNOY⟩, hot men mir oykh gegebn.

332
00:16:47,530 --> 00:16:49,299
s'iz geven DEN' POBEDY,

333
00:16:49,356 --> 00:16:51,358
hot men mir oykh gegebn a fuftsiker,

334
00:16:51,482 --> 00:16:57,146
un VSЁ, hobn zey shoyn dernokh dem UZNAet az ikh hob zikh gut ongemutshet; ikh bin geven in geto, kh'hob zikh gemutshet.

335
00:16:58,637 --> 00:17:02,698
A TAK BOL'SHE NIKTO VAM NIKAKIM OBRAZOM NE, NE NAPOMINAL OB ETOM?

336
00:17:02,063 --> 00:17:05,721
NU, NIKTO NE NAPI- NAPOMINAL, NO MNE VOT,

337
00:17:05,721 --> 00:17:08,987
itstert o, se geyt mir yeder NAVSTRECHe.

338
00:17:08,987 --> 00:17:11,406
ikh, b- bay mir shloft der ZHELUDOK,

339
00:17:11,428 --> 00:17:19,420
hot men mir gegebn a spravke fun der BOL'NITSe in RAYSOBES, un m'hot mir gevolt gebn, KAK BOYOVYKH DIY, hot men mikh gevolt f- shikn LECHen,

340
00:17:19,781 --> 00:17:23,339
n⟨or,...⟩ MIRGOROD mitn ZHELUDOK.

341
00:17:23,339 --> 00:17:27,940
n⟨or⟩ ikh hob zikh OTKAZYVAet. ikh hob gevolt in ⟨STRA⟩SKAVETS' ILI in MORSHYN,

342
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:29,760
vayl ikh bin geven oyf der arbet,

343
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:36,046
dortn vu kh'hob gear⟨bet, bi⟩n ikh geforn tsvey mol atin in MORSHYN ⟨u⟩n ⟨STRA⟩SKAVETS', fleg men mir gebn PUTЁVKes, veys ikh shoyn dem veg.

344
00:17:36,046 --> 00:17:40,667
atin veys ikh nit dem veg, hob ikh zikh opgezogt I VSЁ. s'vet zayn, vet men mir gebn a anders mol.

345
00:17:41,263 --> 00:17:42,708
I VSЁ, vos...

346
00:17:44,149 --> 00:17:46,829
A VOT, KOGDA, VOZNIKLA,

347
00:17:46,829 --> 00:17:48,950
 NEOBKHODIMOST' I VOZMOZHNOST',

348
00:17:48,950 --> 00:17:54,718
 DOKUMENTAL'NO PODTVERDIT' SVOЁ PREBYVANIE V GETTO, POLUCHIT' TOT DOKUMENT, CHTO U VAS EST' RAYSOBESOVSKIY,

349
00:17:54,718 --> 00:17:59,549
 KAKIM OBRAZOM VY, VOT KAK VY NACHALI, TAK SKAZAT', DEYSTVOVAT' V ETOM PLANE?

350
00:17:58,763 --> 00:18:03,094
YA, ikh hob UZNAet bay di mentshn az m'iz gegangen.

351
00:18:03,268 --> 00:18:05,523
iz tsugegangen eyner tsu mir,

352
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,940
a krist, un hot gezogt,

353
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:10,060
"du bist a yidishke?" zog ikh, "yo."

354
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:14,470
"du bist geven VO VREMYA GETTO?" zog ikh, "yo, nor kh'bin geven alt dray yor,

355
00:18:14,470 --> 00:18:16,791
n⟨or⟩ mit der mamen." zogt er mir,

356
00:18:16,791 --> 00:18:18,530
"s'hot nit keyn ZNACHENIE.

357
00:18:18,530 --> 00:18:23,161
nor du bist dokh geven in Bershed; m'hot zikh NUZHDAet in dayn mamen, m'hot zikh NUZHDAet in dir,

358
00:18:23,161 --> 00:18:25,953
zolstu geyn." zog ikh, "vu zhe zol ikh fargeyn?"

359
00:18:25,953 --> 00:18:27,430
hot men mir gezogt,

360
00:18:27,430 --> 00:18:29,126
"gey in RAYSOBES."

361
00:18:29,126 --> 00:18:34,037
bin ikh gegangen in RAYSOBES arayn. iz geven, ETOT, VALETSKIY.

362
00:18:34,037 --> 00:18:35,831
bin ikh arayngegangen tsun im.

363
00:18:35,837 --> 00:18:41,563
zog ikh im, "ikh, du veyst az ikh bin geven in geto un aldings. ikh darf hobn," zog ikh, "a DOKUMENT."

364
00:18:41,563 --> 00:18:43,003
zogt er tsu mir,

365
00:18:43,161 --> 00:18:48,540
 "vos zhe bist geven, vifl zhe bistu alt?" zog ikh, "kh'bin, f- funem akht un draysikstn yor."

366
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:52,844
zogt er, "vos zhe bistu geven, ⟨a-⟩ dray yor dem⟨UNK⟩t? vos zhe hostu shoyn gevust?"

367
00:18:52,844 --> 00:18:57,966
zog ikh, "nu, vel ikh geyn oyfbagrobn mayn mamen, ⟨vet⟩ mayn mame dertseyln. ikh hob zikh mit der mamen gemutshet, aldings."

368
00:18:57,966 --> 00:18:59,678
hot er mir gezogt, "NU, KHOROSHO.

369
00:18:59,678 --> 00:19:03,337
gey nem tsvey SVIDETELes in Bershed, yidn,

370
00:19:03,546 --> 00:19:06,462
az du bist, geven DEYSTVITEL'NO."

371
00:19:06,462 --> 00:19:08,546
UNK zog ikh, "KHOROSHO, kh'vel geyn."

372
00:19:08,546 --> 00:19:11,218
un ZHORNITSKIY iz geven der predsyedatel.

373
00:19:11,545 --> 00:19:14,562
iz dem MOMENT ⟨iz⟩ ZHORNITSKIY ⟨nit⟩ geven, s'iz geven a anderer.

374
00:19:14,562 --> 00:19:23,624
hot zi mir, hot er mir gezogt, heyst es., bin ikh gekumen, iz gegangen mit mir Tsimerman Lyube un s'iz gegangen, der potshtalyon, Yoske.

375
00:19:23,624 --> 00:19:28,113
m'iz gekumen, m'hot gezogt, ⟨un⟩ m'hot farshribn a papir, un ikh hob dertseylt aldings.

376
00:19:28,113 --> 00:19:30,270
m'hot gezogt, hot men mir aroysgegebn ⟨dem⟩ DOKUMENT.

377
00:19:30,985 --> 00:19:32,160
RAYSOBES?

378
00:19:31,086 --> 00:19:33,155
hot er gezogt, ⟨ikh bin⟩... RAYSOBES.

379
00:19:33,887 --> 00:19:34,741
VSЁ.

380
00:19:35,406 --> 00:19:41,220
TAK CHTO, KAKIKH-TO SLOZHNOSTEY U VAS NE BYLO V POLUCHENIEM... PRAKTICHESKI...

381
00:19:35,845 --> 00:19:37,230
..

382
00:19:38,967 --> 00:19:42,150
NE, NE BYLO SLOZHNO- NE, NE.

383
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:45,373
 VY POLUCHILI MATERIYAL'NUYU POMOSHCH' OT GERMANII?

384
00:19:45,058 --> 00:19:45,966
yo.

385
00:19:45,598 --> 00:19:46,940
VY POLUCHILI.

386
00:19:45,966 --> 00:19:47,173
kh'hob POLUCHet.

387
00:19:47,173 --> 00:19:52,916
kh'hob POLUCHet, TYSYACHA mark. ⟨nu, azoy, azoy m'hot yedn gegebn⟩, m'hot mir gegebn, DA.

388
00:19:49,193 --> 00:19:53,220
NU, SKOL'KO UNK SKOL'KO VSEM, STOL'KO VAM DALI.

389
00:19:53,428 --> 00:19:57,742
nu, ikh hob gegebn di kinder a bisl, nu, un s'iz mayne problemes, ⟨azoy⟩ zogt men...

390
00:19:56,787 --> 00:20:00,934
UNK ⟨BRUNYA, YA NE⟩ SPRASHIVAYU SKOL'KO. YA SAM FAKT,...

391
00:19:58,170 --> 00:20:03,513
NE, NE, NE, YA ZNAY-, VSE ZNAYUT, CHTO U MENYA... ikh darf, ikh darf hobn moyre?

392
00:20:00,934 --> 00:20:03,226
DA, SAM FAKT UNK

393
00:20:03,503 --> 00:20:04,256
⟨DA⟩.

394
00:20:03,891 --> 00:20:07,834
DA, POLUCHILA. itstert zogt men, mir darfn oykh epes POLUCHen.

395
00:20:08,093 --> 00:20:12,609
tsi yo tsi neyn, veys ikh nit., yo, mir hobn aroysgenemen spravkes; eynike zogt men

396
00:20:11,603 --> 00:20:12,390
DA.

397
00:20:12,615 --> 00:20:15,830
f-, fir, un ⟨der, ober⟩ zibn. ⟨NE ZNAYU⟩.

398
00:20:15,568 --> 00:20:17,067
nu, vifl ⟨vet zayn⟩,

399
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:17,689
az mir veln POLUCHen, veln mir zen.

400
00:20:17,067 --> 00:20:19,140
vifl vet zayn ⟨vet zayn⟩.

401
00:20:18,015 --> 00:20:20,690
vifl vet zayn vet zayn, DA.

402
00:20:20,749 --> 00:20:25,330
A KOGDA VY, UNK SPISOK SOSTAVLYALSYA,

403
00:20:25,330 --> 00:20:30,649
BYVSHIKH UZNIKOV GETTO, ETO, V OBSHCHESTVE UZNIKOV, KOTOROE ZHORNITSKIY ⟨UNK⟩AL,

404
00:20:30,688 --> 00:20:33,550
VY TUDA PRISHLI S ⟨ET-, S DOKUMENTОM⟩?

405
00:20:32,055 --> 00:20:39,662
NU, KONECHNO ZHORNITSKIY PRISHЁL UNK ET⟨UNK⟩ DOKUMENT⟨Y⟩ OFORMIL⟨I,⟩ TAM SIDELA ZHENSHCHINA I IZOLEVSKIY, I VSE SIDELI,

406
00:20:39,662 --> 00:20:45,819
I KONECHNO SPRASHIVALI MENYA I VSЁ, KOGDA ETO BYLO GETTO I VSЁ. YA SKAZALA IM, VSЁ ZAPISALI. A KAK ZHE!

407
00:20:47,884 --> 00:20:49,205
NO VAM NIKTO NE S-

408
00:20:49,205 --> 00:20:52,029
KAKIKH-TO PREPYATSTVIY TAM NE BYLO?

409
00:20:50,989 --> 00:20:55,880
YA ZHE ZNALA, CHTO V GETTO... KOGDA MOYA S- mayn shvester iz avekgeforn in IZRAILe,

410
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:58,000
hot zi dokh oykh gedarft hobn dos papir.

411
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,305
zi iz dokh oykh gegangen.

412
00:20:58,633 --> 00:21:00,348
TAK. ONA POLUCHILA...

413
00:20:59,305 --> 00:21:01,431
⟨vos zhe hob ikh gevoynt...⟩ A KAK ZHE!

414
00:21:00,793 --> 00:21:03,660
A KAKIM OBRAZOM ONA POLUCHI-...?

415
00:21:01,431 --> 00:21:05,390
oykhet neme⟨n, ge-⟩ tsvey SVIDETELes genemen do.

416
00:21:04,995 --> 00:21:06,879
ONA ESHCHЁ TOGDA ZHILA ZDES'?

417
00:21:06,868 --> 00:21:08,350
DA. DA.

418
00:21:08,134 --> 00:21:09,562
aha, ONA ZHILA...

419
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:12,864
 ONA BYLA VO VREMYA GETTO ZDES' V BERSHADI, hot zi genemen tsvey SVIDETELes

420
00:21:10,632 --> 00:21:11,756
⟨NE...⟩

421
00:21:12,864 --> 00:21:17,476
un m'hot ir oykh gegebn dos bikhele. A KAK ZHE! yo, zi iz gekumen in Bershed, m'iz gegangen mit ir.

422
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:19,547
iz eyner, a yid,

423
00:21:19,547 --> 00:21:23,011
ikh veys nit, fun DONETSK. er iz gegangen ibern veg, er iz geshtorbn.

424
00:21:23,389 --> 00:21:24,600
VY POMNITE?

425
00:21:24,132 --> 00:21:24,970
DA.

426
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:29,457
hot men im, hot er, iz er gegangen, un zayn vayb iz gegangen, hot zi gehat tsvey SVIDETELes, VSЁ.

427
00:21:30,848 --> 00:21:35,162
I V IZRAILE ETO⟨T⟩ DOKUMENT NUZHEN, ⟨TAKIM LYUDYAM⟩?

428
00:21:33,649 --> 00:21:41,010
 nu, EY ⟨S-,⟩ m'hot ir gezogt az zi darf hobn oto dem, ⟨K-⟩ DOKUMENT., ⟨oyb⟩ me darf hobn dem DOKUMENT, hot zi genemen,

429
00:21:41,010 --> 00:21:44,007
un zi hot genemen a DOKUMENT az der foter iz gefaln oyfn front,

430
00:21:44,007 --> 00:21:47,515
un ⟨az⟩ di mame iz geshtorbn. ale DOKUMENTn darf men hobn.

431
00:21:46,761 --> 00:21:52,627
ZNACHIT, U VAS TOZHE EST' VSE ETI DOKUMENTY I ESLI VY RESHITE, DOPUSTIM, UEKHAT', TAK ONI U VAS EST'.

432
00:21:50,119 --> 00:21:57,622
ESLI BY ikh vel fo-... UNK MAMINY EST', KOGDA MAMA UMERLA EST' DOKUMENT I YA MOGU V VОENKOMAT VZYAT'.

433
00:21:56,278 --> 00:22:03,562
I, I U VAS EST' DOKUMENT, CHTO VASH OTETS P-, PROPAL NA FRONTE? EST' U VAS, DA? ⟨UNK⟩TE

434
00:22:00,092 --> 00:22:03,130
A KAK ZHE. A KAK ZHE. EST', NO ⟨Y-⟩...

435
00:22:03,130 --> 00:22:06,760
NE, YA NE ZNAYU, YA POSMOTRYU, ⟨ILI ONO EST' DA ILI⟩ NET, NO

436
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:09,370
me ken mir gebn in, VOENKOMAT.

437
00:22:09,370 --> 00:22:15,206
ikh kum tsu geyn in VOENKOMAT un zog avoser yor zukhn op, I VSЁ. zi hot zikh oykh genemen funem VOENKOMAT.

438
00:22:14,250 --> 00:22:17,079
aha, ZNACHIT, VY ZNAETE O TOM, KAK ETO SDELAT'.

439
00:22:15,617 --> 00:22:17,906
A KAK ZHE, A KAK ZHE, VSЁ.

440
00:22:17,963 --> 00:22:19,324
aldings veys ikh.

441
00:22:19,238 --> 00:22:23,240
ETO KHOROSHO. ETO KHOROSHO.

442
00:22:22,131 --> 00:22:24,724
volt zi nor gezogt, dos kind, forn, VSЁ.

443
00:22:27,514 --> 00:22:34,380
BRUNYA, CHTO VY MOZHETE SAMI CHTO-TO RASSKAZAT', OB ETOM VREMENI, O ⟨SV-⟩ O SVOEY ZHIZNI, CHTO-TO

444
00:22:34,380 --> 00:22:36,860
KHARAKTERNOE, SVYAZANNOE S ⟨V-⟩ S EVREYSTVOM,

445
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:41,410
IZ TOGO, CHTO YA, DOPUSTIM, NE SPROSIL VAS, POTOMU CHTO YA NE ZNAYU, CHTO...?

446
00:22:40,525 --> 00:22:42,949
O SEBE, O SEBE RASSKA-...?

447
00:22:41,410 --> 00:22:42,983
DA, O SEBE, DA.

448
00:22:43,174 --> 00:22:50,053
NU, CHTO YA MOGU RASSKAZAT' O SEBE? ikh ken dertseyln fun zikh, az ikh hob zikh mit mayne tsvey kinder gut oykh ongemutshet.

449
00:22:50,683 --> 00:22:52,921
ikh hob gevoynt,

450
00:22:52,962 --> 00:22:55,656
ah, PO ULITSE OKTYABR'SK⟨e⟩.

451
00:22:55,813 --> 00:22:58,169
s'iz geven a tsebrokhene shtub.

452
00:22:58,412 --> 00:23:00,366
ikh hob geRODet eyn kind.

453
00:23:00,366 --> 00:23:01,984
di mame iz nokh geven.

454
00:23:02,023 --> 00:23:04,930
un dos kind hot gehat VOSPALENIE LЁGK⟨e⟩.

455
00:23:04,930 --> 00:23:09,622
dernokh hob ikh geRODet dos tsveyte kind, un s'iz gekumen di mame, un mir hobn gevoynt shtark orem.

456
00:23:09,622 --> 00:23:10,837
hot zi gezogt,

457
00:23:10,837 --> 00:23:12,921
"vos darfstu hobn tsvey kinder?

458
00:23:12,921 --> 00:23:15,107
host eyn kind MAECHke, ⟨hob⟩,

459
00:23:15,107 --> 00:23:17,762
un ANECHKen vest iberlozn in BOL'NITSe."

460
00:23:17,818 --> 00:23:19,215
hob ikh gezogt,

461
00:23:19,215 --> 00:23:22,557
"vos zhe zikh onmutshen nayn khadoshim

462
00:23:22,557 --> 00:23:26,464
un hobn a, a kind, un avekgebn dos kind?" zog ikh, "neyn, mame.

463
00:23:26,464 --> 00:23:27,940
⟨azoy⟩ ikh vel zikh mutshen,

464
00:23:27,940 --> 00:23:29,585
ikh nem dos kind aheym."

465
00:23:29,585 --> 00:23:35,880
nu, hob ikh genemen dos kind aheym un mir hobn zikh gemutshet. kh'hob zikh gemutshet, ober kh'hob gearbet, kh'hob zey VOSPITYVet, I VSЁ.

466
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:40,323
nor, zogt men, azoy zogt men, BLAGODARYA di melukhe,

467
00:23:40,667 --> 00:23:44,200
darf ⟨men⟩ zogn, ⟨iz, zi⟩ hot mir geholfn.

468
00:23:43,468 --> 00:23:44,970
geholfn.

469
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:49,082
oyf alе... kh'hob POLUCHet KAK MAT'-ODINOCHKA oyf tsvey kinder,

470
00:23:49,341 --> 00:23:53,672
un di fabrike iz gegangen mir NA KAZHDOM SHAGU NAVSTRECHe,

471
00:23:53,813 --> 00:23:56,135
un ikh hob oyfgetsoygn di tsvey kinder.

472
00:23:56,142 --> 00:24:04,742
nu, ⟨azoy⟩ s'iz gegangen di regns, ⟨azoy s'iz⟩ gefaln un aldings, di kinder zenen gevaksn bay mir sheyne tsvey tekhter. nu, vos zhe ken ikh nokhet zogn?

473
00:24:04,883 --> 00:24:10,175
NO ZHIZ⟨N',⟩ dos lebn iz bay mir ibergegangen shtark shlekht.

474
00:24:10,367 --> 00:24:12,853
ikh hob zikh ongemutshet azoy vayt,

475
00:24:12,853 --> 00:24:16,270
nor itster leb ikh a bisl.

476
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:19,839
far vos zhe leb ikh a bisl? vayl m'hot mir gegebn a gute KOMNATe.

477
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:23,051
ikh voyn in a gute KOMNATe: heytsung darf ikh nit,

478
00:24:23,125 --> 00:24:25,956
⟨,⟩ dos darf ikh nit, keyn holts darf ikh nit,

479
00:24:25,956 --> 00:24:27,382
s'iz mir varem,

480
00:24:27,382 --> 00:24:32,951
un s'iz mir UYUTNe, eyn KOMNATe, un ikh hob, IZVINYAY⟨SYA⟩, a tualet vu arayntsugeyn.

481
00:24:32,951 --> 00:24:37,043
ikh leb itster! dem⟨UNK⟩t hob ikh zikh gemutshet; itster leb ikh.

482
00:24:37,043 --> 00:24:42,137
veys ikh nit vos tsu tun, tsi ⟨mi- mir,⟩ in IZRAILe vet mir zayn beser, tsi do iz beser. kh'veys aleyn nit vos.

483
00:24:42,582 --> 00:24:48,021
s'iz aza zakh vos me ken nit, me ken nit zogn un me ken nit visn.

484
00:24:44,927 --> 00:24:47,030
v⟨ey⟩sn, me ken ⟨nit⟩ v⟨ey⟩sn...

485
00:24:48,021 --> 00:24:52,350
zog "for", vet men zoln zayn shuldik. "for nit" iz oykh... ⟨dos⟩ veys men nit.

486
00:24:52,403 --> 00:24:54,619
di shvester shraybt mir az s'iz ir gut.

487
00:24:54,619 --> 00:24:57,318
zi hot fir KOMNATes un zi hot genemen UNK

488
00:24:57,318 --> 00:24:59,079
oyf akht un tsvontsik yor.

489
00:24:59,220 --> 00:25:04,445
nu, hot zi a zun. der zun arbet un di tokhter, arbet, un zi hot pensye, er hot pensye.

490
00:25:04,485 --> 00:25:08,920
ikh veys? far ts- fir yor, dos ferde yor, hot zi mir shoyn geholfn tsvey mol,

491
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:14,090
zol zayn gezunt un shtark: eyn mol hundert dolars aroysgeshikt, dem andern ⟨mol⟩ hundert dolars aroysgeshikt.

492
00:25:14,090 --> 00:25:16,531
hayntiks yor hot zi nit gekent aroysshikn mit Fanyen,

493
00:25:16,531 --> 00:25:20,670
ibergebn, derfar vos der, shvoger darf geyn oyf OPERATSIYA KATARAKT,

494
00:25:20,753 --> 00:25:22,265
hot er, oyf beyde oygn.

495
00:25:21,110 --> 00:25:22,822
UNK dortn?

496
00:25:22,558 --> 00:25:24,440
dortn. VSЁ.

497
00:25:27,520 --> 00:25:32,200
N⟨U, A V- ⟩, POKA V GOSTI ONA VAS NE MOZHET PRIGLASIT', CHTOBY PO⟨SMOTRE-...⟩

498
00:25:30,912 --> 00:25:34,444
⟨NU, KH-⟩ POCHEMU? zi ken mikh betn in GOSTI.

499
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:33,530
MOZHET?

500
00:25:34,290 --> 00:25:36,862
⟨, f-⟩ far vos forn.

501
00:25:34,444 --> 00:25:36,187
nu, darf ⟨ikh zikh⟩ hobn gelt

502
00:25:36,413 --> 00:25:38,640
far vos tsu forn. far vos vel ikh forn?

503
00:25:38,303 --> 00:25:39,917
zi kon nit UNK...

504
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:44,017
vos ikh POL- ikh POLUCHAe dem pensye, hob ikh POLUCHet far eyn khoydesh, VSЁ, ⟨m'hot shoyn dem⟩ dritn khoydesh, me git nit keyn pensye.

505
00:25:44,412 --> 00:25:45,941
nu, far vos zhe zol ikh forn?

506
00:25:46,858 --> 00:25:51,875
un forn vel ikh forn, vel ikh zikh kumen in GOSTI, vel ikh zayn dortn tsvey vokhn UNK kumen, ikh zol zen, vos...

507
00:25:51,875 --> 00:25:55,570
UNK tsu forn darf men POSTOYANNOE ZHITEL'STVO. VSЁ.

508
00:25:55,988 --> 00:26:00,386
ober ahin, ober ater. hob ikh shoyn ⟨a, atin⟩ mit a fus, ater vel ikh shoyn nit aroys, I VSЁ

509
00:26:01,998 --> 00:26:03,390
PONYAL?

510
00:26:04,729 --> 00:26:07,527
DA, VOOBSHCHE INTERESNА ETA ZHIZN'; ONA

511
00:26:07,527 --> 00:26:09,549
KAZHDOGO VEDЁT PO-SVOEMU.

512
00:26:08,830 --> 00:26:10,832
DA, KAZHDOGO PO-SVOEMU.

513
00:26:11,378 --> 00:26:22,280
VY VOOBSHCHE, STOYKAYA ZHENSHCHINA. VY SUMELI TRIDTSAT' PYAT' LET RABOTAT' NA TAKOM TYAZHЁLOM PROIZDODSTVE. YA NEMNOGO POMNYU KOGD- KOGDA VY RABOTA-

514
00:26:20,929 --> 00:26:22,830
KOGDA VY RABOTALI ESHCHЁ.

515
00:26:22,280 --> 00:26:24,920
KOGDA ⟨MY R-⟩ YA TOZHE TAM RABOTAL NEMNOGO.

516
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:35,040
 VY POMNITE, TAM BYLO MNOGO ZHENSHCHIN, KOGDA-TO RABOTALI NA FABRIKE? VY MOZHETE VSPOMNIT' IKH? VED' VY IKH ZNALI. YA IKH, PLOKHO POMNYU UNK

517
00:26:33,619 --> 00:26:39,564
NU, EVREI, ZHENSHCHINY EVREYSKIE, ETO BYLO MALO. ETO BYLO,

518
00:26:39,289 --> 00:26:41,071
A NAZOVITE ⟨KHOT'⟩...

519
00:26:39,564 --> 00:26:45,070
, SARA, MOYA POKOYNAYA⟨, ETO⟩ MISHINA ZHENA PERVAYA, RABOTALA.

520
00:26:45,070 --> 00:26:49,171
POTOM YA RABOTALA. POTOM SARA Trenker RABOTALA.

521
00:26:50,308 --> 00:26:52,259
POTOM, PO-MOEMU...

522
00:26:53,143 --> 00:26:55,820
KTO ESHCHЁ IZ EVREEV? MALO EVREEV.

523
00:26:55,725 --> 00:26:56,782
ZHENSHCHIN.

524
00:26:55,978 --> 00:26:58,047
 ZHENSHCHIN⟨,⟩ DA.

525
00:26:58,290 --> 00:27:03,020
A MUZHCHINY TOZHE MALO RABOTALI. MISHKA Trenker TAM, I,

526
00:27:03,020 --> 00:27:08,120
 KTO ESHCHЁ, RABOTAL TAM? EVREEV MALO RABOTAL.

527
00:27:09,006 --> 00:27:10,620
EVREE⟨V M-...⟩

528
00:27:09,512 --> 00:27:14,917
yidn veynik. yidn veynik oyf der fabrike. gole goyim BOL'SHINSTVO. yidn veynik.

529
00:27:14,777 --> 00:27:18,710
ETO POSLEDNIE GODY, ILI KOGDA VY UNK?

530
00:27:14,917 --> 00:27:16,730
SCHITANNYE EVREI.

531
00:27:17,528 --> 00:27:21,859
DAZHE NACHALO GODY, I POSLEDNIE. SKOL'KO YA RABOTALA, TAK yidn veynik.

532
00:27:22,708 --> 00:27:26,957
 nu, Shkolnik hot gearbet, BORIS. BELLA Shkolnik.

533
00:27:26,957 --> 00:27:28,713
hob ikh ⟨far- nit⟩ gedenkt zey.

534
00:27:28,713 --> 00:27:31,390
⟨ONI ZHE TOZHE IZ BERSHA-...⟩ ONI RABOTALI.

535
00:27:28,834 --> 00:27:29,908
UNK

536
00:27:31,390 --> 00:27:33,730
nu, un MOZHET SOBRALIS' TAM

537
00:27:33,730 --> 00:27:37,823
tsvontsik, yidn tsi draysik yidn, I TO oykh nit.

538
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:42,851
 GDE ONI SEYCHAS, PO PREIMUSHCHESTVU, TE, KTO ZHILI, KAK VY SCHITAETE?

539
00:27:42,115 --> 00:27:44,437
zenen in IZRAILe.

540
00:27:44,325 --> 00:27:45,804
VSE V IZRAILE.

541
00:27:44,713 --> 00:27:46,496
ale ⟨in⟩ IZRAILe.

542
00:27:48,072 --> 00:27:51,136
DA, ⟨ETO⟩ DEYSTVITEL'NO TAK.

543
00:27:50,822 --> 00:27:54,894
ale ⟨in IZRAILe⟩. nu, un in kantor hot gearbet B-, BORIS Abramovitsh,

544
00:27:54,894 --> 00:28:01,514
un s'hot gearbet, dortn, nokh UNK Kogon hot gearbet a mayse bay, bay mir.

545
00:28:01,808 --> 00:28:05,261
a gute mayse geven. ikh bin gegangen eyn mol tsun im...

546
00:28:05,892 --> 00:28:07,220
⟨nu,⟩ TAK.

547
00:28:08,001 --> 00:28:09,480
ON NE OBIZHAL VAS?

548
00:28:09,503 --> 00:28:12,247
NE! kh'hob im getrogn milekh.

549
00:28:12,574 --> 00:28:17,700
zi hot gemakht UKOLn, az ikh hob ge- m'hot gedarft, ⟨MARA⟩.

550
00:28:18,092 --> 00:28:25,050
zayn mame, ir mame hot mikh UVAZHAet., zey hobn mikh UVAZHAet. ikh fleg arayngeyn I VSЁ. ⟨ven er iz⟩ avekgeforn in IZRAILe

551
00:28:25,050 --> 00:28:27,334
bin ikh geven oyf a PROVOZHANIE bay im.

552
00:28:30,242 --> 00:28:34,430
YASNO. A VY B- BYLI NA ⟨V-⟩ PROVOZHANII,

553
00:28:34,430 --> 00:28:37,697
 VASHIKH, KOLLEG PO FABRIKE DRUGIKH?

554
00:28:37,697 --> 00:28:40,462
VOT KROME KOGONA, ESHCHЁ U KOGO-TO VY BYLI?

555
00:28:39,540 --> 00:28:42,943
nu, Vayserman, YA KONECHNO bin ikh nit geven.

556
00:28:42,949 --> 00:28:44,512
A U KOGO VY BYLI?

557
00:28:43,202 --> 00:28:45,924
NU, A MOZHET Vayserman NE SDELAL I VSЁ.

558
00:28:45,924 --> 00:28:49,119
U KOGONA YA BYL I U SONI Trenker.

559
00:28:49,564 --> 00:28:51,200
U SONI Trenker.

560
00:28:50,374 --> 00:28:52,106
DA, I U SHKOL'NIKA.

561
00:28:52,112 --> 00:28:54,030
 I U SHKOL'⟨UNK⟩.

562
00:28:52,737 --> 00:28:54,401
bay ale yidn UNK.

563
00:28:54,913 --> 00:28:59,311
kh'hob zey nokh PROVOZHAet oykhet, SHKOL'NIKY. UNK mayn eydem iz geven, di tokhter iz geven.

564
00:29:03,351 --> 00:29:07,450
A S KEM VY IZ NIKH, VOT, S TEMI, KOTORYE RABOTALI NA FABRIKE,

565
00:29:07,450 --> 00:29:11,698
 IZ EVREEV, VY S KEM-TO, DRUZHILI BLIZKO ⟨I⟩...?

566
00:29:10,624 --> 00:29:12,356
SONYA Trenker.

567
00:29:12,143 --> 00:29:14,128
VY S NEY OBSHCHALIS',...?

568
00:29:13,273 --> 00:29:14,667
OCHEN' DAZHE.

569
00:29:14,708 --> 00:29:16,260
OCHEN' ⟨BLIZ-⟩...

570
00:29:14,927 --> 00:29:18,172
YA ⟨KOG-...⟩ ONA BYLA U MENYA DOMA, YA U NEЁ DOMA,

571
00:29:18,172 --> 00:29:22,037
I KOGDA MOYA DOCHKA VYSHLA ZAMUZH, ONA, hot zi mir geholfn,

572
00:29:22,037 --> 00:29:24,574
 bakn, kokhn un aldings.

573
00:29:25,018 --> 00:29:27,003
ONA PERVAYA BYLA U MENYA.

574
00:29:27,668 --> 00:29:28,927
un DUSYA

575
00:29:30,621 --> 00:29:32,102
BYLA. VOT ETI.

576
00:29:32,102 --> 00:29:33,483
ETA DUSYA, DA.

577
00:29:34,266 --> 00:29:38,320
 BRUNYA, MY SDELAEM ESHCHЁ ODIN PERERYVCHIK MALEN'KIY.

578
00:29:37,287 --> 00:29:38,680
POZHALUYSTA.

